Error [E0153]: Protocol `Payment` failed to expand into handle types
  --> tests/ui/protocol_out_of_order.jet:7:10
    |
  7 | protocol Payment {
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: The compiler generates `#SingleUse` `.Client`/`.Server` stubs from the protocol block — a fragment did not parse
 Fix: Check the protocol declaration for typos; if this persists, file a bug
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0153

Error [E0107]: Nothing named `Payment` exists here
  --> tests/ui/protocol_out_of_order.jet:15:10
    |
 15 |     h :: Payment.Client.client()
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Declare it first: `Payment :: ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [E0311]: `Charge` isn't a method on this value
  --> tests/ui/protocol_out_of_order.jet:18:8
    |
 18 |     h1.Charge(500) ?? panic("charge failed")
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: This `Int` value has no instance method named `Charge`
 Fix: Check the spelling of `Charge`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0311
